    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n48533" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">tonsūra</span></b> , ae, f.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				shearing</i>, <i>clipping; a pruning</i>, <i>trimming</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quidam in anno bis tondent (oves) ac semestres
					faciunt tonsuras,</span>”
				<i>wool - shearings</i>, <i>shearings</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 2, 11, 8</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">primae lana,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					28, 8, 29, § 115</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capillorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov. A.
					A. 1, 517</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vitis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					17, 27, 45, § 257</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">16, 37, 68,
				§ 175</span></i>.</div>
